  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Ornament Fundraiser</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4850 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-bank-shows category-events category-meet-the-artist category-monthly-meetings category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news\" id=\"post-4850\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"330\" height=\"242\" alt=\"A red and white logo.\" src=\"/media/archive/d628430c893acef788bc2bbe74472c5859c7875a114ebdc857cc9102d0377062.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Guild News December 2019</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-11-27T14:16:00-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, November 27, 2019, 2:16 pm\">November 27, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Compiled by Joan Carroll The General Meeting will take place on January 25, 2020, not January 18, due to the Martin Luther King Holiday, from 2:00-4:00 p.m. Michael Rudden encourages <a href=\"/news/guild-news-december-2019/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-4043 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-news\" id=\"post-4043\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/art-gallery-revised-fall-hours/\"><img class=\"landscape cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"687\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A house with a red awning and a christmas tree.\" src=\"/media/archive/e0fdd25f2f4631ab828b21d0c2ddc6efec3f7be2ca22b46b7cd641fbf38d7c86.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/art-gallery-revised-fall-hours/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Art Gallery Revised Fall Hours</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-11-10T12:20:15-05:00\" title=\"Saturday, November 10, 2018, 12:20 pm\">November 10, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists (GHA) Gallery is now open November 23, Black Friday, and Saturday &amp; Sunday of Thanksgiving Weekend.  The member run gallery will also be open Friday, <a href=\"/news/art-gallery-revised-fall-hours/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder post-3533 post type-post status-publish format-standard category-education category-events category-ornament-fundraiser category-the-gallery category-gallery-artists category-news tag-annual-ornament-fundraiser tag-cape-cod tag-christmas-in-harwich tag-guild-of-harwich-artists tag-harwich-childrens-fund tag-harwich-ma tag-the-childrens-center tag-the-guild-of-harwich-artists\" id=\"post-3533\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"402\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Three woman and a cheque\" src=\"/media/archive/5aaa89ed4b76470d775ac1096a3ba906daf2de3810417c82b495b1ab8f8d7014.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" rel=\"bookmark\">Local Organizations Benefit from Annual Fundraiser</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2018-01-29T20:50:39-05:00\" title=\"Monday, January 29, 2018, 8:50 pm\">January 29, 2018</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>The Guild of Harwich Artists’ Annual Ornament Fundraiser held during the Harwich Christmas Stroll and on the following weekends at the Art Gallery, was a huge success. Total proceeds after <a href=\"/news/local-organizations-benefit-from-annual-fundraiser/\" class=\"more-link\">[…]</a></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
